[resource]
script = ExtResource("1_item_data")
item_name = "Field Journal"
item_description = "A worn leather journal with handwritten notes."
item_type = 1
note_text = "Day 1 - Arrival

The cabin is exactly as described in the listing. Remote, quiet, surrounded by pine forest. Perfect for a weekend of bird watching and sketching.

But something feels... off.

The previous tenant left in a hurry. I found this journal in a drawer, along with some scattered notes. They mention a creature they call 'Hasselmus' — a shadow entity that stalks the forest at night.

According to their notes:
- It only moves when you're not looking directly at it.
- It feeds on fear, growing stronger each night.
- The flashlight is your only defense. Keep it charged.
- Batteries can be found scattered around the property.
- DO NOT follow it into the dark.

I thought it was the ramblings of a paranoid mind. But last night, I saw something moving between the trees. A tall, thin figure with too many joints.

I'm staying one more night to investigate. If you're reading this... be careful. And keep the flashlight on.

— Elias

P.S. There are more notes hidden around the cabin. Find them. They might help you survive."
scene_to_spawn = ExtResource("2_note_scene")
